==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|certeynte||surety}}, from {{der|en|xno|certeinte}}, from {{der|en|fro|certeinete}}, from {{der|en|VL.|*certānitās}}, from {{der|en|la|certus}}.

